   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "The OSI CHEM SCREEN is a more effective alternative to traditional downhole chemical treating. Through micro-encapsulation technology all the active components of the most effective liquid chemical treatments, in the petroleum industry are processed in a solid stick form.",
   "box": {
    "x": 679,
